  displayName: Master Sergeant Jakoby
  role: 1
  description: 'A veteran ISF Master Sergeant who leads by example rather than from
    behind. Unlike the Field Commander he gives no accuracy bonus to nearby troops
    (no Lead from the front); instead he fights: a Shotgun (10 damage, penetration
    1, 10 m) and two Frag Grenades to throw as his action. With 10 health and Armor
    Level 2 he can take a hit, but as a Solo unit he''s a prime target. A Commander:
    every army needs exactly one.'
